<<include"OC Richard NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

Caring, loyal, and sweet boy who enjoys teasing his close ones. A vivid and competitive gamer, a computer geek, and a universe lover who can often be found playing a video game or stargazing. Richard loves to help others whenever he can, as he finds joy in the happiness of his friends. He's shy with new people, but once he befriends them, he becomes a bubbly, snuggle boy.

